  "interpretation": [
    "Factor-matrix dots account for about30% of evaluation CPU samples; gadget work outside NTT/CRT about18%; NTT about12%.",
    "OpenMP runtime accounts for about0.3% of evaluation CPU samples. These samples do not support prioritizing OpenMP wait-policy tuning.",
